	(text "SIDE-WALL ELECTRODE BOARD - one design, fitted on both side walls (the right one is\nthe left one turned over). Pads face the enclosure wall (the plastic is the dielectric)\nand are solder-mask covered. J1 cables to J302 (left) / J303 (right) on the main board:\n1 = lower zone, 2 = GND, 3 = upper zone. GND is a hatched pour on the back only.\nGeometry: hardware/enclosure/params.py (EB_*, ELECTRODE_*)."
